{
    "title": "RepairSolutionsPRO",
    "description": "RepairSolutionsPRO\r\nHave an SDS43 or SDS50 tablet? Take your Innova SDS tablet experience to the next level with our new RepairSolutionsPRO app!\r\n\r\n**** IMPORTANT ****\r\nThe app is free to install but requires the purchase of INNOVA\u2019s new SDS series tablets.\r\nThis app will NOT work with other INNOVA branded tools or dongles.\r\n**********************\r\n\r\nRSPRO is designed to work seamlessly with our latest SDS50 and SDS43 diagnostic tablets. It\u2019s ideal for automotive technicians who want to keep track of vehicle performance and troubleshooting information. Download our app today!\r\n\r\nMultiple Report Types\r\nYou can view four different types of reports (Diagnostic, Customer, Collision, and OBD2) submitted from your SDS tablet. We designed each report type to show exactly what you need and nothing you don't.\r\n\r\nFree OEM Vehicle Information\r\nGet MIL DTC, TSBs, Recalls, Predicted Failures, Warranty Status, Scheduled Maintenance, and More!\r\n\r\nCompare Pre & Post Scan Results\r\nOnce the report is in the app, you can generate Pre and Post Scan reports for each vehicle and share results with customers.",
    "descriptionHTML": "RepairSolutionsPRO<br>Have an SDS43 or SDS50 tablet? Take your Innova SDS tablet experience to the next level with our new RepairSolutionsPRO app!<br><br>**** IMPORTANT ****<br>The app is free to install but requires the purchase of INNOVA\u2019s new SDS series tablets.<br>This app will NOT work with other INNOVA branded tools or dongles.<br>**********************<br><br>RSPRO is designed to work seamlessly with our latest SDS50 and SDS43 diagnostic tablets. It\u2019s ideal for automotive technicians who want to keep track of vehicle performance and troubleshooting information. Download our app today!<br><br>Multiple Report Types<br>You can view four different types of reports (Diagnostic, Customer, Collision, and OBD2) submitted from your SDS tablet. We designed each report type to show exactly what you need and nothing you don&#39;t.<br><br>Free OEM Vehicle Information<br>Get MIL DTC, TSBs, Recalls, Predicted Failures, Warranty Status, Scheduled Maintenance, and More!<br><br>Compare Pre &amp; Post Scan Results<br>Once the report is in the app, you can generate Pre and Post Scan reports for each vehicle and share results with customers.",
